Data that ships inside this package
-----------------------------------

`src/targum/annotate/paradigms.json.gz` — Hebrew verb conjugations, 4,703 verbs and
about 145,000 forms, derived from the Wikidata lexeme dump of 2026-09-11.

Wikidata's data is released under CC0 1.0 Universal, which waives copyright entirely:
<https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>. No attribution is required and this
notice claims nothing over it. It is recorded here because knowing where a file came from
and on what terms is worth more than the paperwork it saves.

Rebuilt by `scripts/hebrew_paradigms.py`, which names the dump it read.

`src/targum/disposable.txt` — about 9,960 throwaway e-mail domains, which the back
office reads to flag a sign-up from one (targum-internal#544). Vendored from
<https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains>,
`disposable_email_blocklist.conf` at commit fa960072882ed3e629ffdc064d2ccb9d5b461c2f
(2026-10-27), and never fetched at runtime.

That list is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
<https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/>. No attribution is required; it is
recorded here for the reason the paradigms are.
